  "keyFeatures": [
    "Unified market data across Polymarket, Kalshi, and Predict.fun",
    "Order execution with cross-venue routing",
    "Real-time WebSocket streams for orderbooks, trades, and prices",
    "Agora private auction house for institutional block trades",
    "Sports markets with live cross-platform matching",
    "Trader analytics including PnL history and position tracking",
    "Combo/parlay markets on Polymarket",
    "Self-custody signing with EIP-712 support",
    "Perpetuals market data via Hyperliquid integration",
    "Market screener with presets for finding opportunities"
